  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d5562cc34807e2439c5cc188b7351d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Step_35_StaticIP_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Instructor
    text: "LO3.3 - PREPARE AND COMPLETE THE REPORT\n\nDocument the completed job
      on the service report form:\n\n  - Server name and IP configuration\n  - Roles
      installed and the domain created\n  - Accounts, groups and share permissions\n 
      - Printer and folder redirection settings\n  - Result of each of the five tests
      from your test plan\n  - Date, technician name, and supervisor's signature"
  - speakerName: Instructor
    text: An undocumented job is an incomplete job- the report is what the client
      and the assessor actually receive.
